610	     3	 *
611	     4	 * This module owns one underwriting policy: which properties of an item the
612	     5	 * office considers risky, and what surcharge each of those risks carries. Such
613	     6	 * a risk surcharge is always charged on the base premium of the affected item
614	     7	 * alone, never on the policy total — that is what makes it item-specific and
615	     8	 * keeps it apart from the policy-wide modifiers that depend on the customer's
616	     9	 * history rather than on the item.
